{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>2026年選委會界別分組一般選舉將於11月22日（周日）舉行，選委會選舉提名期上周三（7日）開始，2026年選舉委員會界別分組一般選舉有關界別分組的選舉主任今（12日）共接獲206份候選人提名表格及11份指定團體提名表格，即合共217份提名申請。自提名期開始，至今共接獲962份候選人提名表格及23份指定團體提名表格，提名期將於下周二（20日）結束。</p><figure><img alt=\"2026選委會選舉提名期提名期將於下周二（20日）結束。。圖為2016年選委會選舉。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210616/481900169714864128250671.jpeg/dcJ3axuRGEqgHax2q3P6TOidCmUuf7iNQqGGf0Khhn8\"/><figcaption>2026選委會選舉提名期提名期將於下周二（20日）結束。。圖為2016年選委會選舉。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>各界別分組接獲的候選人提名表格數目如下：</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186417364107792384947685.png/v19Eqsae_QMHA665_nTl9ZVr5qnuF-BuVEd91lRHfdY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186417366624505856128567.png/V_nRmsDm-6a7lmA9-jy5ydpBHpwKRbMZ71g0Te9YNE0\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186417369120247808319765.png/xbAsleXuWWifGGXQ_C354lEcHmVUEHevaEkVhmhJFYY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186417726650847232391652.png/YmWxcqOLj4_C1Jg6Eoz9BeIHxBU2vLxYCY4HgAmOB4A\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T13:19:32.972658+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":245,"images":5,"source":"HK01 社會","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T13:02:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T02:58:30.845263+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T13:17:59.221709+00:00","content_hash":"8d4aad630ad15bce8f3cdc5df22d078f50794131199ab9464d988dc3d8b890da","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}